  "description": "Conformance test 33a (ZQ4): test 19 as a preview. HighlightParcels(x 10..15 × z 10..13, all set; type 1; null point; &out), first without the zone written (code 2 is real-mode only), then with it, then again. S, C, D, Q and flag are test 19's. The street stub records a Place with realMode false as a street draft (flags 0x8, a nonzero mask byte per edge towards a neighbouring cell of the segment), logged as 'P(…) draft'. The Place log is P(12,10,12,13) with realMode false. CreateLotIfPossible with code 8 records a virtual lot {x1, z1, facing} on every cell (20 entries) and creates no lot. *out is a new region equal to the input (rect {10, 10, 15, 13}, 24 cells). ClearHighlight resets the street (3) and road (0) tools, not the dirt road. Every case: no real lot, no AttemptAreaLevelling, no locked lot, both DeferOccupantOperations messages posted; on return real mode, zone type 0, point null; the maps and the street drafts remain. Calling it again gives the same result.",
